  a. the Licensor has first provided specific written authorization; or
  b. the activity is solely for a Qualifying Open Project, is non-commercial,
     every model weight, dataset, training or retrieval configuration, prompt
     or context derived from the Software, and resulting source artifact is
     publicly available without charge, and no AI service operator may retain
     or use the Software for an unrelated model, dataset, product, or service.

Merely publishing source code or model outputs is not enough to satisfy the
exception if the AI System, relevant dataset, weights, or reproducible process
remain closed. An AI System may not rely on this exception to improve a closed,
hosted, or commercially available model or service.

